u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u262a\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVerr6gD", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 93, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8880899, "raw_content": "https://nataliegwinters.substack.com/p/who-picks-your-town-google-backed\n\nI'm not one to normally look at substacks, but this one caught my attention.\n\n\"GeoMatch\u2019s published funding roster names Google.org, the Rockefeller Foundation, and Schmidt Futures. Technology money and major foundations have helped build a system that recommends where refugees should settle.\n\nAn algorithm cannot create an apartment, add a classroom, or hire a doctor. If its capacity assumptions are wrong, residents and refugees live with the consequences. Americans deserve to know which limits the system measures, who supplies the numbers, and who answers when those numbers are wrong.\"\n\nExplains another fucking vector into how there's another layer to the bullshit immigration invasion.", "author": "BlisteringClock", "created": 1791721769078, "profile_picture": "vfk5n9dQU0k0", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "beggarwaste", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Ai Tech Bro's Picking Which White Towns Get invaded", "last_comment_created": 1791735818317, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://nataliegwinters.substack.com/p/who-picks-your-town-google-backed\" target=\"_blank\">https://nataliegwinters.substack.com/p/who-picks-your-town-google-backed</a></p>\n<p>I'm not one to normally look at substacks, but this one caught my attention.</p>\n<p>&quot;GeoMatch\u2019s published funding roster names Google.org, the Rockefeller Foundation, and Schmidt Futures. Technology money and major foundations have helped build a system that recommends where refugees should settle.</p>\n<p>An algorithm cannot create an apartment, add a classroom, or hire a doctor. If its capacity assumptions are wrong, residents and refugees live with the consequences. Americans deserve to know which limits the system measures, who supplies the numbers, and who answers when those numbers are wrong.&quot;</p>\n<p>Explains another fucking vector into how there's another layer to the bullshit immigration invasion.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 93, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2109315965431517264", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVesyfeU", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 17, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8881532, "raw_content": "", "author": "PatriotSam", "created": 1791753696282, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Formerlurker92", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVesyfeU.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/Cobratate/status/2109315965431517264?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Free the Tate brothers", "last_comment_created": 1791755882626, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 